---

<Layout
  title="Primary vs Secondary ADC12: What the Certificate Does Not Tell You | Tech Aluminum"
  description="Two ADC12 certificates can both say EN AC-46000 and cast completely differently. Residual elements, die soldering, porosity and how to spot the difference before it reaches your furnace."
  lang="en"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />

